### GET request to example server
GET https://examples.http-client.intellij.net/get
    ?generated-in=IntelliJ IDEA

### Create monitor

POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/monitors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "kind": "http",
  "address": "https://example.com",
  "interval_seconds": 30,
  "timeout_seconds": 5,
  "expected_status": 200,
  "expected_body": ""
}

### Get monitor

GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/monitors/1

### List monitors

GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/monitors?user_id=1

### Delete monitor

DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/monitors/5

### Update monitor

PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/monitors/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expected_status": 200
}

### Create TCP monitor

POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/monitors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "kind": "tcp",
  "address": "example.com:443",
  "interval_seconds": 30,
  "timeout_seconds": 5,
  "expected_status": 200,
  "expected_body": ""
}

### Break TCP monitor

PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/monitors/6
Content-Type: application/json

{
"address": "127.0.0.1:1"
}

###
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/monitors/6
Content-Type: application/json

{
"address": "example.com:443"
}